  - 'I poured the potion into the fish tank and jumped in. It felt strangely familiar,
    as if I had done this many times before.


    (Press space to continue)'
  - 'My body began to burn... and then, suddenly, I realized that I had become a
    fish.


    (Press space to continue)'
