  itemId: Bone
  dependencies: []
  prePickupDialogue: I saw something in the crystal ball.... I can't see it clearly....
    seems like a Bone
  lockedDialogue: The mist inside won't clear... I feel like I'm missing something
    important.
  postPickupDialogues:
  - I remember I was a dog...
  - I was running between multiple things.. training myself my speed.
  - The scent of adventure was everywhere.
